          The requirement behind TPS row 235 is TPS 6.1.1, verbatim:
            "Access filter for management I/F, which denies all packets addressed to the
             management I/F other than those packets that come from user specified
             network(s) or host(s). Also TCP/UDP port number of all services such as
             telnet, SNMP, ICMP and etc. is configurable."
